    "text": "21 hours ago LINCOLN–(KFOR Sept. 26)–Lincoln Transportation and Utilities (LTU) this week announced that portions of several Lincoln streets will close beginning the week of September 28. The closures are as follows:. Westbound “O” Street between Ninth and 16th streets will close Monday, September 28, for water main replacement work as... Read full article\n1",
